{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfdrErX7r8WuCwSiZTnL9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JTDZGbYSwqayPkWkkcGGUt","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"PY=/Users/brenn/.cache/uv/builds-v0/.tmpWHFCeM/bin/python; F=../agent/brace-findings.json; A=\"$PY scripts/answer.py $F\"\nU(){ $A check \"$1\" --met unknown --note \"$2\"; }\nfor c in A01.1 A01.2 A01.3 A01.4; do U $c \"agent.py has no deployment, IaC, RBAC, or credential code; client and db are injected by the host (agent.py:17, :30). Searched all of agent/ for serviceAccount, role, token, subject_token, act/sub: nothing. Identity lives outside this repo.\"; done\n$A item A01 --rating needs_evidence --confidence low --summary \"The repo defines no agent principal, credential source, delegated subject, or permission binding; all are host-supplied.\" --next \"Provide IaC/identity config showing a dedicated agent principal, token exchange with separate act/sub, and agent-only revocation.\"\n$A check A02.1 --met no --evidence agent.py:13 --quote 'await db.execute(\"INSERT INTO events(run_id, action, context, result) VALUES($1,$2,$3,$4)\",' --note \"The only audit writer stores run_id, action, context, result. No accountable party, owner, tenant, agent-type-id, instance-id, or trace context.\"\n$A check A02.2 --met no --evidence agent.py:27 --quote 'await db.execute(\"UPDATE quotas SET spent=spent+1 WHERE id=$1 AND spent+1<=cap RETURNING id\", key)' --note \"Quota refusal path writes no audit record and the result is ignored. The loop exit at agent.py:39-40 after 4 turns without done also writes none. Every record() call lacks the six fields.\"\n$A check A02.3 --met no --evidence agent.py:13 --quote 'await db.execute(\"INSERT INTO events(run_id, action, context, result) VALUES($1,$2,$3,$4)\",' --note \"No trace_id/span_id/traceparent column or value in the record.\"\nU A02.4 \"No tenant or owner is written to records at all. run.tenant is only used for quota keys (agent.py:26); its provenance is host-supplied and not in this repo.\"\n$A flag A02 --evidence agent.py:13 --note \"Audit writer record() stores only run_id/action/context/result; none of the six identity fields.\"\n$A item A02 --rating gap --confidence high --summary \"Event records carry only run_id, action, context and result, none of the six identity fields.\" --next \"Add a shared audit wrapper that stamps accountable party, owner, tenant, agent-type-id, instance-id and trace context on every record, including refusals and failures.\" --violates \"every action records the accountable party, operational owner, tenant, agent-type-id, agent-instance-id, and trace context\" --also-affects A04\nfor c in A03.1 A03.2 A03.3 A03.4 A03.5; do U $c \"No code in agent/ computes an agent-type-id or manifest (searched sha256, hashlib, type_id, manifest: none). It may be computed in CI or the host outside this repo. Model IDs route-2026-09 and main-2026-09 at agent.py:18,37 are dated names but are not tied to any hash.\"; done\n$A item A03 --rating needs_evidence --confidence low --summary \"No type-id hashing or manifest exists in this repo; it may live in CI or the host.\" --next \"Supply the code/CI step that hashes container digest, harness, prompt, model version and config in sorted order, plus tests.\"\n$A check A04.1 --met unknown --note \"run.tenant and run.user (agent.py:26) come from the host-supplied run object; verification is outside this repo. No model-fillable tenant/instance field was found.\"\nU A04.2 \"No tool handler or header middleware is in this repo; tool calls are not dispatched here.\"\n$A check A04.3 --met no --evidence agent.py:13 --quote 'await db.execute(\"INSERT INTO events(run_id, action, context, result) VALUES($1,$2,$3,$4)\",' --note \"Record schema has no delegated-subject field separate from agent identity.\"\nU A04.4 \"No queue or async job is enqueued here; the handoff in decide() returns text in-process (agent.py:20)